                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First level is hard.  Second level, okay, I somehow got through that level.  Third level, WTF.  Seriously, what kind of sadistic devs are these?  Why did they make this look like a children's game.  Fourth level, no way.  There's no effing way anybody can get through this.  After several deaths and much perserverance, I get to the cheese.  Fifth level ... looks at maze ... tries one time, then rage quits.  \n\nOkay so maybe rolling rat mode in classic levels is not for me.  Let's try board tilt.  First level .... how do you even?  No way, rage quit.  Pin wheel?  Ahhh... finally ... one easy level.  \n\nWarning: Don't even try first person view, you can't see anything.\n\nRating 5/10.  I hate my life now.",
